Symbol icons in this directory are from Tabler Icons.

Source:  https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons  (https://tabler.io/icons)
License: MIT License

These are the SF-Symbols-style monochrome set offered in the app's
"Change Icon" picker (the "Symbols" section). Unmodified outline SVGs,
rendered in the UI via a CSS mask so they paint in the current text color.
